OL,3,GNEWSATributes paid to cyclist killed in
OL,4,APort Glasgow crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FTributes have been paid to a cyclist
OL,7,Fwho died in a crash on a busy road in
OL,8,FInverclyde.
OL,10,FIain McTavish, 46, was one of three
OL,11,Fcyclists in a collision with a blue
OL,12,FFord C-Max Zetec on the A8 in Port
OL,13,FGlasgow shortly after 19:00 on Tuesday.
OL,14,FHe died at the scene.
OL,16,FTwo other male cyclists, aged 37 and
OL,17,F27, were taken to hospital following
OL,18,Fthe crash on the road's westbound
OL,19,Fcarriageway between the Langbank and
OL,20,FWoodhall roundabouts.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
